      "justification": "vulnerable_code_cannot_be_controlled_by_adversary",
      "impact_statement": "В рамках платформы не передаются скомпрессированные данные, эксплуатация невозможна.",
      "timestamp": "2025-10-09T11:31:17.452121Z"
    },
    {
      "vulnerability": {
        "@id": "https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-5932",
        "description": "The golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp package is unmaintained, unsafe by design, and has known security issues that will not be fixed.",
        "name": "GO-2026-5932"
      },
      "products": [
        {
          "@id": "pkg:golang/golang.org/x/crypto"
        },
        {
          "@id": "pkg:golang/golang.org/x/crypto@v0.54.0"
        }
      ],
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_not_in_execute_path",
      "impact_statement": "GO-2026-5932 affects unmaintained golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp with no fixed version. In the kube-rbac-proxy image, openpgp is present only as a transitive dependency of golang.org/x/crypto; the kube-rbac-proxy binary does not use OpenPGP functionality. openpgp code is not in the execute path, so the vulnerability is not reachable for this image.",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-03T17:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "vulnerability": {
        "name": "CVE-2026-27145",
        "description": "crypto/x509: Denial of Service via excessive processing of DNS SAN entries"
      },
      "products": [
        {
          "@id": "pkg:golang/stdlib@v1.25.8"
        }
      ],
      "status": "not_affected",
      "justification": "vulnerable_code_cannot_be_controlled_by_adversary",
      "impact_statement": "crypto/x509: Denial of Service via excessive processing of DNS SAN entries. Образ kube-rbac-proxy собран с Go stdlib v1.25.8 (Deckhouse builder golang:1.25.8, GOTOOLCHAIN=local). Исправление требует bump Go toolchain выше версии builder; будет выполнено в рамках планового апгрейда builder-образа. В текущей конфигурации модуля входные данные для уязвимых путей stdlib ограничены доверенным control-plane/административными сценариями, что исключает практическую эксплуатацию со стороны недоверенного нарушителя.",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-07T12:00:00Z"
    },
